# Resend — same setup as Fuente de Vida Residencial (server-only, no public keys).
# https://resend.com
#
# 1. Create an API key at https://resend.com/api-keys and paste it below.
# 2. Until a custom domain is verified, EMAIL_FROM can stay on onboarding@resend.dev
#    (delivers only to the Resend account email). Visitor confirmation may fail until
#    mulberry-dev.com is verified in Resend.
# 3. CONTACT_RECIPIENT_EMAIL is the inbox that receives project briefs. Leave empty
#    to use the public contact address (mulberry.developer@gmail.com).
# 4. EMAIL_LOGO_URL must be a publicly reachable absolute URL for Gmail/Outlook.
#
RESEND_API_KEY=
CONTACT_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=mulberry.developer@gmail.com
EMAIL_FROM=mulberry-dev <onboarding@resend.dev>
EMAIL_LOGO_URL=https://mulberry-dev.com/images/Icons/logo.png
